---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service (Owner Draft) — ExamPath Lab"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of ExamPath Lab educational materials and services."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Legal' },
    { label: 'Terms of Service' }
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    
    <!-- Draft Notice -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-900 mb-8">
      <strong>Owner-Review Working Draft:</strong> This document serves as a foundational operating framework during our pre-commercial testing phase. Finalized legal terms must be confirmed prior to large-scale commercial transactions.
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl text-[#172633] mb-6">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-sm text-[#536471] space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#172633]">1. Nature of Service</h2>
        <p>ExamPath Lab provides bilingual self-paced study guides, formula frameworks, memory flashcards, and verified question drills for aspirants preparing for Indian government examinations. ExamPath Lab is an independent publisher and has no official affiliation with the Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS), Staff Selection Commission (SSC), Railway Recruitment Boards (RRB), State Public Service Commissions, or any governmental agency.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#172633]">2. No Guarantees of Examination Outcome</h2>
        <p>While all educational materials are meticulously fact-checked for mathematical correctness and syllabus alignment, ExamPath Lab makes no warranties or representations regarding examination success, cut-off marks, or final job selection. Examination performance depends entirely on individual candidate diligence, preparation, and external test conditions.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#172633]">3. Intellectual Property & Fair Use</h2>
        <p>All original explanations, mnemonic associations, synthesized summary charts, and proprietary question sets published on this website are the intellectual property of ExamPath Lab. Users are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable personal license to view, download, and print free study materials for individual, non-commercial educational use. Redistribution, automated scraping, or resale is strictly prohibited.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#172633]">4. Pilot Phase Deliveries</h2>
        <p>During the pilot testing phase, digital study packs are fulfilled manually via email or WhatsApp following verification of transaction records. Expected delivery timelines range between 2 to 6 hours during standard operating hours.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
